    rather than repeated in the section bodies. Two images appear in the
    Excavations prose (a south-west gate photograph captioned "Parts of the
    excavations (Damascus gate)" and one captioned "A tablet from the
    archive") but are not among the file names given in the front-matter image
    list, so they are not in the image plan; the infobox photograph of the
    outer wall and "Damascus Gate" is likewise not in that list. Ebla's own
